{"schema_version":"benchmark-q1-semantic-issue-coverage-judgment-luna5","question_id":"Q1-semantic-issue-coverage","status":"ok","judge_run_name":"luna8-api-v4-medium-mimo-v26pro-rl-max-full200-n03","prediction_set_name":"mimo-v26pro-rl-max-full200-n03","paper_id":"2510.11949","judge_input_sha256":"7cc75b059f7b582670e10923564b2f4d42cabd93cd430996baec8870dedf0d93","gold_decisions":[{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I001","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I001:U002","2510.11949:I001:U003","2510.11949:I001:U009"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U008"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns the covolume normalization in counting integer points of D0 and Dgamma. ISSUE-003 concerns the ambient row dimension of a lattice basis and its effect on an FPLLL runtime estimate; it does not identify the missing lattice-density factor or the associated counting obligation.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I002","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I002:U002","2510.11949:I002:U003","2510.11949:I002:U007"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U005","ISSUE-002:U009"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the strict-boundary exclusion in Dgamma that omits the guaranteed vector at gamma=±1. ISSUE-002 instead diagnoses an incorrect gcd case split in the iteration-order proof and does not recognize the boundary membership or the required boundary correction.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I003","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I003:U002","2510.11949:I003:U003","2510.11949:I003:U008"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U008"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the false global 1/beta3 perturbation bound for the truncated lattice vector, including the missing dependence on ||z||_1 and the need for a projected top-block argument. ISSUE-003 concerns only the dimension count of the lattice basis and the resulting runtime logarithm, not perturbation control or rounding.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I004","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I004:U001","2510.11949:I004:U003","2510.11949:I004:U007"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U008"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns the mismatch between the truncated last coordinate ±floor(beta3 beta0)/beta3 and the algorithm's exact ±beta0 test. ISSUE-003 identifies a separate ambient-dimension error in the lattice basis and does not diagnose the scale-dependent coordinate compatibility condition.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I006","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_obligation_or_hypothesis","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I006:U001","2510.11949:I006:U002","2510.11949:I006:U007"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U004","ISSUE-003:U005","ISSUE-003:U008"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the invalid substitution of an expected value E[K] into a claimed worst-case per-iteration runtime bound, with a deterministic K bound needed instead. ISSUE-003 changes the lattice ambient dimension and FPLLL logarithmic factor; it does not recognize the expectation-versus-worst-case quantifier failure.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2510.11949:I007","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-001","focus_relation":"no_substantive_overlap","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2510.11949:I007:U001","2510.11949:I007:U003","2510.11949:I007:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-001:U001","ISSUE-001:U004","ISSUE-001:U008"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is an empirical table-count and percentage error in the 11-by-13 inversion example. ISSUE-001 is a DFT gcd-condition and scaling error in a proof sketch, with no recognition of the incorrect experimental count or comparison.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]}],"audit":{"all_gold_ids_decided":true,"all_ranked_candidates_considered":true,"target_type_not_used_for_identity":true,"severity_not_used_for_identity":true,"prediction_reuse_requires_explicit_issue_support":true,"each_gold_credited_at_most